{
  "name": "Record",
  "comment": "The run FreshAppGoesOn.test.goal resumes: Record calls Sub, Sub saves the run, and Record keeps the snapshot in\nworkspace/run.plang (a .plang file holds it signed, as the save signed it). %count% is set by the test before it calls\nRecord, never here: a Record or Sub run twice counts on from the saved count, so it shows.",
  "step": [
